Library: community.ferruslogic.library.photonjson

Type: library

Title: PhotonJSON

Version: 1.2.5

Author: DTByte-Ltd

Description: LiveCode script library for working with JSON, written in livecode-script and without the use of external.


Name: JSONParser

Type: function

Syntax: JSONParser(<pJsonString>)

Summary: Parse JSON text into a LiveCode array.

Parameters: 

pJsonString: String containing UTF-8 encoded JSON text

Returns: A LiveCode array (Array).

Synonyms: JSONToArray, arrayFromJson

Description:
<JSONParser> is used to convert data encoded in JSON format into a LiveCode
array. It parses <pJsonString> and returns resulting array.



Name: minifyJSON

Type: function

Syntax: minifyJSON(<pJsonString>)

Summary: Remove unnecessary spaces from JSON string.

Parameters: 

pJsonString: The UTF-8 encoded JSON data to be minified.

Returns: Minified JSON data.

Description: Remove unnecessary characters from JSON data.




Name: beautifyJSON

Type: function

Syntax: beautifyJSON(<pJsonString>,<pIndentSize>)

Summary: JSON string formatted in a more visually pleasing way.

Parameters: 

pJsonString: The UTF-8 encoded JSON data to be beautify.

Returns: UTF-8 JSON string.

Description: JSON string formatted in a more visually pleasing way.




Name: ArrayToJSON

Type: function

Syntax: ArrayToJSON(<pArray>,<pForceRootType>,<pPretty>)

Summary: Format a LC array into UTF-8 encoded json data.

Parameters: 

pArray: The array to be formatted

pForceRootType: The type to force values to.

pPretty: Set to true to format the resulting JSON data nicely.

Returns: JSON data.

Synonyms: JSONStringify

Description: Format a LC array into UTF-8 encoded json data.




Name: jsonFromArray

Type: function

Syntax: jsonFromArray(<pArray>)

Summary: Format a LC array into UTF-8 encoded json data.

Parameters: 

pArray: The array to be formatted

Returns: JSON data.

Description: Format a LC array into UTF-8 encoded json data.




Name: JSONToArray

Type: function

Syntax: JSONToArray(<pJsonString>)

Summary: Parse JSON text into a LiveCode array.

Parameters: 

pJsonString: String containing UTF-8 encoded JSON text

Returns: A LiveCode array (Array).

Synonyms: JSONParser, arrayFromJson

Description:
<JSONParser> is used to convert data encoded in JSON format into a LiveCode
array. It parses <pJsonString> and returns resulting array.



Name: validateJSON

Type: function

Syntax: validateJSON(<pJsonString>)

Summary: Validate if a string is a valid JSON.

Parameters: 

pJsonString: The UTF-8 encoded JSON data to be verified.

Returns: A Boolean.

Description: Validate if a string is a valid JSON.




Name: JSONStringify

Type: function

Syntax: JSONStringify(<pArray>,<pForceRootType>,<pPretty>)

Summary: Format a LC array into UTF-8 encoded json data.

Parameters: 

pArray: The array to be formatted

pForceRootType: The type to force values to.

pPretty: Set to true to format the resulting JSON data nicely.

Returns: JSON data.

Description: Format a LC array into UTF-8 encoded json data.




Name: arrayFromJson

Type: function

Syntax: arrayFromJson(<pJsonString>)

Summary: Parse JSON text into a LiveCode array.

Parameters: 

pJsonString: String containing UTF-8 encoded JSON text

Returns: A LiveCode array (Array).

Synonyms: JSONParser, JSONToArray

Description:
<arrayFromJson> is used to convert data encoded in JSON format into a LiveCode
array. It parses <pJsonString> and returns resulting array.



